The <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/09/apple-watch-series-12-announced-all-day-hr-sensor/">Apple Watch Series 12</a> is now available for pre-order, and unlike last year's model, it brings a substantial list of changes over its predecessor. Here's everything that's new.<br/>
<br/>
